<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Optus Vision to launch MTV channel.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Optus Vision to launch MTV channel.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pay tv operator Optus Vision said on Tuesday that it had finalised an agreement to launch a 24-hour MTV (Music Television) channel on its pay television service in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Optus Vision said that through a multi-year licensing agreement with ARC Music Television, a joint venture between Austereo Ltd, Village Roadshow Ltd and Optus Vision, Music Television would also be available on its satellite service after July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>MTV is owned by U.S. cable television and entertainment group Viacom Inc.	     -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
